  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc5/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review @100b6fbb6e (smart-test last changed e98c083991): count_executed_tests and summarize_pytest_output were taken from scripts/smart-test:556+ and run with exit 4, no junit, and a pytest 'unrecognized arguments: --cov' log. That gives executed=unknown, zero_run=false, and the output 'COVERAGE: (all files at 100%)'. The zero-run guard at :809-812 does not catch exit 4 + unknown, although its own comment says exit 4 is covered. MECHANISM: zero_run requires exit 5 or a counted 0; exit 4 with no junit and no result line counts as 'unknown', so the coverage section prints vacuously. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kazig, WI-palah."  # 02f0
